NIC GROUP PLC DIRECTORS:
Notes:
P V Shah and J Somen resigned from the Board of NCBA Group PLC on 20 November, 2019;
D A Oyatsi, J I Ngunze, A H Abdi, J S Armitage, I O Awuondo and M K R Shah, who were all previously
Directors of Commercial Bank of Africa Limited (CBA), were appointed to the Board of NCBA Group PLC
on 20 November, 2019;
D A Oyatsi was previously the Chairman of the Board of Directors of CBA; J I Ngunze was previously the
Chief Executive Officer of CBA;
I O Awuondo was previously the Group Managing Director of CBA, and is the current Chairman of NCBA
Bank Kenya PLC.
